# What a Docker build never needs: installed dependencies, build output, the
# Apple and desktop apps, and local scratch. Keeps the build context small.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/ios
apps/android
apps/desktop
apps/site/screenshots
**/target
**/DerivedData
.git
.github
.claude
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
